      "id": "TSA-C",
      "sd_section": "III.C",
      "title": "Access control",
      "outcome_text": "Establish a memorized-secret (password) reset schedule with documented mitigations for components that cannot be reset; apply multi-factor authentication or equivalent-strength compensating controls; manage access by least privilege and separation of duties; limit and control shared/group accounts; review domain trust relationships on a schedule.",
      "sd_citation": "SD Pipeline-2021-02C III.C.1-5",
      "notes": "Compensating controls are explicitly permitted for industrial control workstations under 49 CFR 192/195 -- an OT-specific carve-out, not a generic IT control.",
