      "sd_section": "III.D",
      "title": "Continuous monitoring and threat detection",
      "outcome_text": "Prevent and audit malicious email/IP/domain/code activity; monitor for and respond to unauthorized code execution and command-and-control communications; continuously collect and analyze data for intrusions and anomalous behavior with sufficient retention for investigation; maintain mitigation/manual controls to isolate ICS during an IT-side incident.",
